      "extract": "arXiv:1809.08419v1 [math.GR] 22 Sep 2018 GR¨OBNER-SHIRSHOV BASES FOR NON-CRYSTALLOGRAPHIC COXETER GROUPS JEONG-YUP LEE AND DONG-IL LEE∗ Abstract. For the noncrystallographic Coxeter groups of type H, we construct their Gr¨obner- Shirshov bases and the corresponding standard monomials.",
