      ],
      "extract": "Let $G$ be the Coxeter group of type $H_4$, and take the complex field $\\mathbb{C}$ as our base field. Then the group algebra $\\mathbb{C}[G]$ is generated by four elements $s_i\\ (i=1,2,3,4)$ with the defining relations: $$\\begin{aligned} {\\rm (quadratic\\;\\; relations)} & s_1^2=s_2^2=s_3^2=s_4^2 =1, \\label{quadratic relations}\\\\ & (s_1s_2)^5=(s_2s_3)^3=(s_3s_4)^3 =1=(s_1s_3)^2=(s_1s_4)^2=(s_2s_4)^2. \\end{aligned}$$",
      "extractCut": true
